OL,3,ARoyal Navy sailor in court accused of
OL,4,Apreparing to spy for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands that the
OL,7,Fallegations against Young include
OL,8,Ftranslating a message into Russian and
OL,9,Flooking for a web portal that invited
OL,10,Fpeople to submit information to Russia.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
