OL,3,AUS and Lebanon protecting wanted Syrian
OL,4,Ageneral, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Syrian general wanted for
OL,7,Fcrimes against humanity is being
OL,8,Fbankrolled and protected by the US and
OL,9,FLebanese authorities, a BBC News
OL,10,Finvestigation has found.
OL,12,FBassam al-Hassan, who oversaw Syria's
OL,13,Fchemical weapons programme and was a
OL,14,Fsenior adviser to former President
OL,15,FBashar al-Assad, is being harboured in
OL,16,FLebanon following the Assad regime's
OL,17,Fcollapse in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
