OL,3,AChrista Pike now walking after failed
OL,4,AUS execution, lawyer tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FChrista Pike is "up and walking" while
OL,7,Fin hospital after last week's botched
OL,8,Fattempt to execute her in the US state
OL,9,Fof Tennessee, a member of her legal
OL,10,Fteam says.
OL,12,FPike, 50, who was sentenced to death
OL,13,Fafter murdering Colleen Slemmer with
OL,14,Fher then-boyfriend in 1995, survived
OL,15,Ftwo lethal injections on 30 September.
OL,16,FExperts described it as unprecedented.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
