OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChrista Pike now walking after failed
OL,4,AUS execution, lawyer tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking late on Wednesday to BBC Radio
OL,7,F4's Today programme, lawyer Stephen
OL,8,FFerrell said he had not spoken to Pike
OL,9,Fdirectly but that he had learned she
OL,10,Fwas moving around her hospital room for
OL,11,Fthe first time while still being
OL,12,Fmentally "foggy".
OL,14,FEarlier, a court ordered the state of
OL,15,FTennessee to preserve all evidence
OL,16,Frelated to the failed execution.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
